WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:04.070
User: Hello, OYI.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.240
User: What’s the weather like in Shanghai today?

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:20.380
OYI: It is currently 19°C in Shanghai,
with a 9% chance of rain today.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:30.040
User: I’m feeling down today.
Could you say something comforting?

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:40.020
OYI: Don’t be sad. Things can turn around—
a surprise may be just around the corner.
